{"seq":2,"slug":"mod-matrix","title":"调制矩阵与路由架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/modulation-routing/mod-matrix","wordCount":1436,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"调制矩阵与路由架构\">调制矩阵与路由架构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>调制矩阵（Modulation Matrix）是现代合成器的核心架构，它把&quot;固定接线&quot;升级为&quot;任意连接&quot;：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>源到目的一句话</strong>：任意调制源（Source）可连到任意目标（Destination），每条连接有独立调制量（Amount）。</li>\n<li><strong>源按时间行为分类</strong>：周期信号、一次性信号、演奏信号、随机信号、跟随信号、内部状态各有适用场景。</li>\n<li><strong>Via/Modifier 是&quot;调制的调制&quot;</strong>：一个源可以控制另一条路由的深度，实现演奏者实时塑形。</li>\n<li><strong>音频速率调制质变</strong>：当调制源进入 20 Hz 以上，行为从&quot;参数变化&quot;变为&quot;频谱生成&quot;，即 FM/AM/Ring Mod 的本质。</li>\n<li><strong>复杂度服务于目标</strong>：好的矩阵设计是&quot;按需连&quot;，而非&quot;能连就全连&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"调制矩阵的概念\">调制矩阵的概念</h2><p>调制矩阵（Modulation Matrix）是现代合成器的核心架构——它定义了任意调制源（Source）到任意调制目标（Destination）的连接，每条连接有独立的调制量（Amount）。这种灵活性远超固定连接的经典硬件合成器。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><msub><mtext>Amount</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>Source</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_{dest}(t) = y_{base} + \\sum_{i=1}^{N} \\text{Amount}_i \\cdot \\text{Source}_i(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Amount</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Source</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Source（调制源）</td>\n<td>连续信号</td>\n<td>LFO, Envelope, Velocity, Mod Wheel, Aftertouch, Noise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Destination（目标）</td>\n<td>可调参数</td>\n<td>Osc Pitch, Filter Cutoff, Amp Level, Pan, FX Mix</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amount（量）</td>\n<td>标量</td>\n<td>-100% 到 +100%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Via/Modifier</td>\n<td>第二源控制 Amount</td>\n<td>Mod Wheel 控制 LFO→Pitch 的深度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 源[&quot;调制源 Sources&quot;]&#10;        S1[&quot;LFO 1&quot;]&#10;        S2[&quot;Env 2&quot;]&#10;        S3[&quot;Velocity&quot;]&#10;        S4[&quot;Mod Wheel&quot;]&#10;        S5[&quot;Aftertouch&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 矩阵[&quot;Mod Matrix&quot;]&#10;        M[&quot;路由槽位&lt;br/&gt;Source → Dest&lt;br/&gt;Amount&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 目标[&quot;调制目标 Destinations&quot;]&#10;        D1[&quot;Osc 1 Pitch&quot;]&#10;        D2[&quot;Filter Cutoff&quot;]&#10;        D3[&quot;Amp Level&quot;]&#10;        D4[&quot;LFO 2 Rate&quot;]&#10;        D5[&quot;FX Mix&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    S1 --&gt; M&#10;    S2 --&gt; M&#10;    S3 --&gt; M&#10;    S4 --&gt; M&#10;    S5 --&gt; M&#10;    M --&gt; D1&#10;    M --&gt; D2&#10;    M --&gt; D3&#10;    M --&gt; D4&#10;    M --&gt; D5\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 源[\"调制源 Sources\"]\n        S1[\"LFO 1\"]\n        S2[\"Env 2\"]\n        S3[\"Velocity\"]\n        S4[\"Mod Wheel\"]\n        S5[\"Aftertouch\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 矩阵[\"Mod Matrix\"]\n        M[\"路由槽位&lt;br/&gt;Source → Dest&lt;br/&gt;Amount\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 目标[\"调制目标 Destinations\"]\n        D1[\"Osc 1 Pitch\"]\n        D2[\"Filter Cutoff\"]\n        D3[\"Amp Level\"]\n        D4[\"LFO 2 Rate\"]\n        D5[\"FX Mix\"]\n    end\n    S1 --&gt; M\n    S2 --&gt; M\n    S3 --&gt; M\n    S4 --&gt; M\n    S5 --&gt; M\n    M --&gt; D1\n    M --&gt; D2\n    M --&gt; D3\n    M --&gt; D4\n    M --&gt; D5</pre><h2 id=\"调制源的分类\">调制源的分类</h2><p>调制源按其时间行为分为几类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>控制方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>周期信号</td>\n<td>持续循环</td>\n<td>LFO, Audio-rate Osc</td>\n<td>Rate/Wave</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一次性信号</td>\n<td>Note-triggered</td>\n<td>Envelope, Ramp</td>\n<td>ADSR/曲线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>演奏信号</td>\n<td>来自 MIDI</td>\n<td>Velocity, Aftertouch, Mod Wheel</td>\n<td>演奏者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机信号</td>\n<td>不可预测</td>\n<td>S&amp;H, Noise, Random walk</td>\n<td>概率/范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跟随信号</td>\n<td>追踪输入</td>\n<td>Envelope Follower, Pitch Tracker</td>\n<td>输入信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内部状态</td>\n<td>合成器自身</td>\n<td>Note Number, Voice Index</td>\n<td>固定映射</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Envelope Follower（包络跟随器）是特别强大的调制源——它分析输入音频的响度包络，将其转化为调制信号。常用于：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Env Follower</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>smooth</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Env Follower}(t) = \\text{smooth}\\left(|x(t)|, \\tau_{attack}, \\tau_{release}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Env Follower</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">smooth</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">tt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用</th>\n<th>信号源</th>\n<th>调制目标</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Auto-Wah</td>\n<td>吉他输入</td>\n<td>Filter Cutoff</td>\n<td>弹奏强→更亮</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ducking</td>\n<td>人声</td>\n<td>伴奏音量</td>\n<td>人声响→伴奏让</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应式 FX</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>FX Amount</td>\n<td>安静时更多效果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"via-modifier-调制的调制\">Via/Modifier：调制的调制</h2><p>&quot;Via&quot; 或 &quot;Modifier&quot; 允许一个调制源控制另一条调制路由的深度——这是&quot;调制的调制&quot;（Meta-Modulation）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Effective Amount</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Amount</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>Via Source</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Effective Amount} = \\text{Amount} \\times \\text{Via Source}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Effective Amount</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Amount</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Via Source</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>经典应用：Mod Wheel 作为 Via 控制 LFO→Pitch 的深度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Mod Wheel = 0 → 无 Vibrato</li>\n<li>Mod Wheel = 127 → 全 Vibrato 深度</li>\n<li>中间值 → 演奏者按需引入颤音，避免所有音符都带 Vibrato</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Pitch Mod</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>LFO</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mtext>Amount</mtext><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mtext>MW</mtext><mn>127</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Pitch Mod} = \\text{LFO}(t) \\times \\text{Amount} \\times \\frac{\\text{MW}}{127}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Pitch Mod</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LFO</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Amount</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">127</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MW</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Via Source</th>\n<th>控制什么</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Mod Wheel</td>\n<td>LFO 深度</td>\n<td>手动控制 Vibrato</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Velocity</td>\n<td>Env Amount</td>\n<td>强力=更明亮</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Aftertouch</td>\n<td>Filter Env 深度</td>\n<td>压力=更多表情</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Key Number</td>\n<td>LFO Rate</td>\n<td>高音=更快颤音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Random</td>\n<td>任意 Amount</td>\n<td>每次触发不同</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"调制路由的实践策略\">调制路由的实践策略</h2><p>设计音色时，调制路由的复杂度应该服务于音色目标而非为复杂而复杂。以下是系统化的调制设计流程：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>决策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>音色需要什么&quot;运动&quot;？</td>\n<td>确定哪些参数需要变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>变化是周期性还是一次性？</td>\n<td>LFO vs Envelope</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>变化速度如何？</td>\n<td>Rate/Time 设置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>演奏者需要实时控制吗？</td>\n<td>MIDI 控制器映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>复音中每个音独立还是共享？</td>\n<td>Poly vs Mono 源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>常见调制模板：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>音色类型</th>\n<th>核心调制</th>\n<th>源→目标</th>\n<th>参数建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自然弦乐</td>\n<td>延迟 Vibrato</td>\n<td>LFO→Pitch (Via MW)</td>\n<td>6 Hz, ±20 cents, Fade 500ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Acid Bass</td>\n<td>包络扫频</td>\n<td>Env→Cutoff</td>\n<td>Fast D, 正 Amount</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pad 演化</td>\n<td>慢扫波表</td>\n<td>LFO→WT Position</td>\n<td>0.1 Hz, 三角</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pluck</td>\n<td>快衰频谱</td>\n<td>Env→Cutoff</td>\n<td>0 A, 快 D, 0 S</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Wobble Bass</td>\n<td>节奏 LFO</td>\n<td>LFO→Cutoff (Sync)</td>\n<td>1/4 note, 高 Res</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态 Lead</td>\n<td>力度响应</td>\n<td>Vel→Filter Env Amount</td>\n<td>50–100%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    A[&quot;音色目标&lt;br/&gt;描述想要的声音&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;识别需要的运动&lt;br/&gt;什么参数该变化&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;选择调制源&lt;br/&gt;LFO/Env/MIDI&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;设置路由&lt;br/&gt;Source → Dest&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;调整 Amount&lt;br/&gt;深度适度&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;添加 Via&lt;br/&gt;演奏控制&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;试听迭代&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    A[\"音色目标&lt;br/&gt;描述想要的声音\"] --&gt; B[\"识别需要的运动&lt;br/&gt;什么参数该变化\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"选择调制源&lt;br/&gt;LFO/Env/MIDI\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"设置路由&lt;br/&gt;Source → Dest\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"调整 Amount&lt;br/&gt;深度适度\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"添加 Via&lt;br/&gt;演奏控制\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"试听迭代\"]</pre><h2 id=\"音频速率调制与交叉调制\">音频速率调制与交叉调制</h2><p>当调制源的频率进入音频范围（大于 20 Hz），调制行为发生质变——从听觉上的&quot;参数变化&quot;转变为&quot;频谱生成&quot;。这正是 FM/AM/Ring Modulation 的本质。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调制类型</th>\n<th>源频率</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>频谱特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>颤音 Vibrato</td>\n<td>5–7 Hz</td>\n<td>音高微小周期变化</td>\n<td>无新频率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快 Vibrato</td>\n<td>7–20 Hz</td>\n<td>可闻的不稳定</td>\n<td>轻微边频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FM 合成</td>\n<td>50+ Hz</td>\n<td>新谐波产生</td>\n<td>丰富边频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AM (幅度调制)</td>\n<td>50+ Hz</td>\n<td>边频对称</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>±</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_c \\pm f_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">±</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ring Mod</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>金属/钟声</td>\n<td>无载波仅边频</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Ring Modulation 的数学：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y(t) = x_1(t) \\cdot x_2(t) = A_1 A_2 \\cdot \\frac{1}{2}[\\cos(2\\pi(f_1-f_2)t) + \\cos(2\\pi(f_1+f_2)t)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></s