n class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不是整数比时，产生非谐波频率——这就是 Ring Mod 特有的&quot;金属/外星&quot;音色来源。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Cross Modulation:</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cross Modulation:} \\quad f_1(t) = f_{1,base} + D \\cdot \\sin(2\\pi f_2 t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cross Modulation:</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>交叉调制（Cross Modulation）让两个振荡器互相调制频率，产生极度复杂和不稳定的频谱——经典的实验/噪声合成技术。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 亚音频[&quot;亚音频调制&quot;]&#10;        A[&quot;LFO 5 Hz&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;→ Pitch&quot;| B[&quot;Vibrato&lt;br/&gt;参数变化&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 音频[&quot;音频速率调制&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;Osc B 440 Hz&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;→ Osc A Freq&quot;| D[&quot;FM 合成&lt;br/&gt;频谱生成&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Ring[&quot;Ring Mod&quot;]&#10;        E[&quot;Signal A&quot;] --&gt; F[&quot;乘法器&quot;]&#10;        G[&quot;Signal B&quot;] --&gt; F&#10;        F --&gt; H[&quot;仅和差频&lt;br/&gt;金属质感&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 亚音频[\"亚音频调制\"]\n        A[\"LFO 5 Hz\"] --&gt;|\"→ Pitch\"| B[\"Vibrato&lt;br/&gt;参数变化\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 音频[\"音频速率调制\"]\n        C[\"Osc B 440 Hz\"] --&gt;|\"→ Osc A Freq\"| D[\"FM 合成&lt;br/&gt;频谱生成\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Ring[\"Ring Mod\"]\n        E[\"Signal A\"] --&gt; F[\"乘法器\"]\n        G[\"Signal B\"] --&gt; F\n        F --&gt; H[\"仅和差频&lt;br/&gt;金属质感\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>调制矩阵把固定接线升级为&quot;任意源到任意目标&quot;的可配置连接，每条路由拥有独立的 Amount。</li>\n<li>调制源按时间行为分为周期、一次性、演奏、随机、跟随与内部状态等类别，各有适用场景。</li>\n<li>Via/Modifier 实现&quot;调制的调制&quot;，让演奏者用 Mod Wheel、Aftertouch 等实时控制路由深度。</li>\n<li>实践设计遵循&quot;先确定需要的运动，再选择源与目标&quot;的系统化流程，复杂度应服务于音色目标。</li>\n<li>当调制源进入音频速率，调制行为质变为频谱生成，这正是 FM/AM/Ring Mod 与交叉调制的本质。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"调制矩阵与路由架构","id":"调制矩阵与路由架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"调制矩阵的概念","id":"调制矩阵的概念"},{"level":2,"text":"调制源的分类","id":"调制源的分类"},{"level":2,"text":"Via/Modifier：调制的调制","id":"via-modifier-调制的调制"},{"level":2,"text":"调制路由的实践策略","id":"调制路由的实践策略"},{"level":2,"text":"音频速率调制与交叉调制","id":"音频速率调制与交叉调制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"LFO 与周期调制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/modulation-routing/lfo-modulation"},"next":{"title":"MIDI 控制与表达映射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/modulation-routing/midi-expression"}}